{"server":"cn","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_01_end","groupId":"act49side","stageId":"act49side_01","title":"激石波","storyCode":"TA-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"e7d92c15d329fc3f567bf1538659c3992772abe28c5d4a36801f5a3953392883","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>望日前两日 寅时</>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禀报哨官，自昨日酉时至今日寅时一刻，主街片区八成以上的居民已被安全转移至丙号移动地块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有部分群众，因公务、财物等原因滞留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"督促剩下的百姓尽快处理好手头的事务，不要过分贪恋财物，最后期限已经不远了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，加强各哨卡的安全检查。如有任何可疑分子和异常情况，立即禀报校将。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来百灶城已经开始疏散了......不知道司岁台有没有岁陵最新的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哨卡的人不少......还是尽量不要引人注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......绕路走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐绕过了哨卡，但是在下一个街角，在嘈杂的人群中，他看到了一个本不该出现在这里的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，请问您是哪位......前辈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邙山镇和界园的事，司岁台已经知晓。我奉命来此接应，辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长途劳顿，先去歇息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢前辈关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可现在我还需将信物送回司岁台，镇抚仪式的细节也该第一时间呈报给监正大人，在下不敢松懈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是镇抚仪式完成的凭证，不算要紧，由我转交便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于详细的述职报告，你回去写，稍后再提交也不迟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐的指节下意识地划过口袋中的信物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini04_mountaintop"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此次情况极为特殊，我必须亲手将信物上交，并当面向监正大人说明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有司岁台监正亲笔写的批文，你还有什么疑问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐，知道你一向认真，但眼下形势复杂，不必太过固执。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉前辈，事发突然，我也不知为何任务有如此变动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会质疑监正的命令，那是不是至少可以允许在下一同前往司岁台，面见监正大人，了解情况呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前辈......这是何意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有人不配合大人执行公务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停手......暂且不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来不曾见过，需要司岁台与巡防营共同行动的场合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，当前形势复杂，一应事务均遵战时制度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐，你我再如此拉扯下去，只会贻误战机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我奉命行事。你若是有任何疑问，均可在事后向监正大人询问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“奉命行事”......敢问前辈究竟是奉了谁的命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......军机不可泄漏。左公子，你既出身行伍，不会连这点道理都不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台三百秉烛人，彼此之间互不知晓履历过往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么会知道我的过往经历？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你到底是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"僵持之间，一枚墨色的圆球状物件倏然滚落至众人面前，随即溅射出灰黑色的浓烟，迅速弥漫开来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有埋伏！列阵防御！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话音未落，左乐已纵身跃上檐角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"覆面的秉烛人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年身后响起密密麻麻的脚步声，数名守军朝着他消失的方向一拥而去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家排好队！时间还早，切莫拥挤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1625_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再仔细想想，是不是落在书桌上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对，对！很有可能！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位同学，什么情况？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守、守卫大叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我俩刚刚在城外做完实验，这才听到疏散的消息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1625_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还有很重要的东西落在了学校的实验室里，我们取到后就火速回来！绝不拖沓！您看行不？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在情况已经很紧急了，什么东西这么重要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1625_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是很重要的实验数据！我们花了好多年才完成的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1625_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这个课题能做成的话，也许，也许就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......出示下学生证，然后去那边过安全检查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生&惊慌的学生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多谢大叔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，取到数据后跟着学宫的工作人员转移吧。但是一天之内，务必要离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生&惊慌的学生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位姑娘，请留步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，现在百灶城已经开始全面疏散，没有特殊情况，是不允许进城的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问姑娘有什么事吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈试图混迹在进城的队伍中穿过关口，眼尖的守卫还是发现了她，立刻迎了上来。\n陈有意将裹起来的赤霄往身后藏了藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在......找我的舅舅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我舅舅年事已高，腿脚不便，携带的行李又多——舅妈托我来接他撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？可我记得户部前日下达疏散命令后，就已将城中的留守老人统一接走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我舅舅他不是百灶本地人，是前些时候趁着中秋，到京城游玩的龙门旅客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......向来不合群，很少和人来往，前天起就一直待在旅馆，等我来接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还请阁下出示一下身份文书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门人......姓名，陈晖洁......曾任龙门近卫局，高级警司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您现在......感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因病退役，很多年前的事了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向您致敬，您可以走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您没找到您的舅舅的话，还是可以就近找守卫求助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是一天之内，务必要离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还请问，昨天以来，你是否有见过一个红发红角，块头很大的龙路过关口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是您描述的这个样貌，我怎么觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事，只是随便问问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢，告辞了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！那边的女士！你要去哪——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"集合号？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边发生什么事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后退！大家后退！就近躲避！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各队列注意——保护好哨卡处的平民！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那边黑压压的一片，是......是什么东西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜色深重，浓密的阴云彻底遮蔽月光的时刻，一支“军队”凭空出现在了街道上。\n没有号令，没有鼓声，没有甲胄碰撞武器的声响，也没有行旅叩击大地的震颤。\n那是列森严的、无声的甲士，轮廓模糊，裹挟着深不见底的死寂，向着哨卡飘来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你们有没有听说，当年百灶还没搬上移动平台的时候，就有人在城市里见过鬼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼兵借道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话本里的桥段你也信？我看大概率就是受前段时间的异常天气影响，产生的蜃景！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这蜃景......未免也太真实了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，他们身上的甲胄，和我们根本不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那根本不是什么蜃景——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到那庞大的队伍靠近，守卫这才看清，沉默的甲士面目模糊可怖，形制古老的铠甲上沾染着血迹，仿佛穿越千年的杀神厉鬼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"还不等他反应过来，甲士手中的锋刃已经贴近了他的面庞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"退后！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......影子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禁军学徒横剑斩击，却只是堪堪改变了对方攻击的路线，锈蚀的长矛蕴含的巨大力道令她暗吃一惊。\n锋刃掠过她的头顶，但紧接着又以诡异的角度折返，直逼要害。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"徒有其形——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一名甲士在禁军学徒的斩击下灰飞烟灭。\n但奇怪的是，其余甲士似乎并没有因此而将她视作敌人，他们只是沿着空旷的道路，向前沉默行进，不知欲往何处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"校将！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传令各营，这些甲士并非寻常敌人，千万当心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们看上去对我们并没有直接的敌意，不要主动与之发生冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疏散沿途群众，静观其变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人，这些东西到底从哪来，他们到底是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽调人手，立即将情况同步给司岁台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些伥如果只是行进就罢了，一旦有惊扰平民、擅闯禁区等行为，该制止时，绝不能手软。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营哨官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这般动乱，岁陵中的情势怕是已经刻不容缓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下的旨意，到底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边......已经打起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红色的剑光？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的人群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的天......这支军队是从哪里冒出来的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的人群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们、他们要冲过来了！救命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“字伥”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是这般古老的模样，是哪个人念念不忘的陈年旧梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为祂要醒来了？还是因为，你已经回家了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你没事吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帮了我一次，你认为我该如何回报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回报？不，那倒不用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些怪物不知道是从哪里冒出来的，十分危险，务必当心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈看到眼前女子气定神闲，对动乱视若无睹，甚至还侧过脸，毫不避让地直视着自己的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"注意到女子审视的眼神，陈立即将赤霄剑收回鞘中——即便已经于事无补。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是炎氏之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你应该误会了，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你看来，以一人之志夺万人之志，以一人之智启万人之智，二者区别如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么问这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一时得不出答案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况紧急，现在不是聊这个的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们以后可以再聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气韵端庄的女子","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"未等陈反应，女子的身影便已隐入人群中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好奇怪的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这些突然出现的怪物......是不是和“岁兽”有关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们，好像都是来自同一个方向——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"巡防营的队伍从眼前闪过，左乐将身影收进墙后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城中到底是什么情况......这些人究竟是领了谁的命令？又为何会盯着这个界园带出来的信物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那份批文，的确是监正大人......可是她为何会同他们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是追兵？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对......这是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"关于过往的无数张画像在他的脑海中闪过，最终定格于司岁台所藏的大狩猎图卷上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......父亲的书房里似乎也挂过类似的甲士卷轴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是......伥？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凝神思索的刹那，领头的伥怪已如烈风般向他袭来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的伥怪应声溃散，在侧旁的墙壁上留下浓重的墨痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这墨痕......伥......字伥？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么可能，难道是那位消失的代理人......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人！您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再要纠缠，就别怪我手下无情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大、大人误会了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是见您差点被那怪物袭击，所以才想来帮忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不拿我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人，您别开玩笑了......我只是刚刚接到命令，协助各位秉烛人清剿这一带的怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可有看到其他秉烛人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（城中伥乱，司岁台怎么不来处理......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有巡防营的人，明显是奉了两套截然不同的命令......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......等见到监正大人，一定要问个明白。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......是我误会了，这位兄台，多有得罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此处危险，你也小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刀光流转，左乐旋身解决掉身旁的数只伥怪，转瞬又消失在了巷道深处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好快的身手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......跑这么快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越靠近这个方向，这些字伥的数量就越多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们究竟是从何处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......出来就出来，凶什么凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini04_mountaintop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这个女娃，跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你和那个秉烛人小孩合不来，你们一路进去怕是得先打起来——你要找的东西，让他帮你找就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下跟随我一路，究竟所图何事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么态度，好歹是熟人见面，这种时候不应该高兴点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信老天师她放走你，一定有她的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我无法信任你......一个山海众。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......正义善良的司岁台左公子，知道你瞧不上我们旁门左道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是眼下在你被司岁台自己人追捕的时候，我们能不能稍微通力合作一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中一定有什么误会才对......等我面见监正大人，自然会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你怎么知道我被司岁台追捕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"榆木脑袋！刚才你被那群人围住的时候，要不是我出手，你早就被逮起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时那人——是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是我！不然谁还会在司岁台抓人的时候出手捣乱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在我特意救了你一命的分上，你能不能记我一点好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近伥物猖獗，姑娘——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......这些鬼东西全冒出来了，情况比我想的还要紧张点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"废话少说，你从界园里带出来的东西呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？你也想要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不会告诉你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女转身，指向四周依然在不断聚拢而来的字伥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不听我的话，你要是有办法对付这些东西，我也没意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那枚信物，你知道该怎么用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别废话，快点拿出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"犹豫片刻后，左乐终于从口袋里掏出了那只被小心保存起来的“玩偶”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个颜色......真的是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是在哪里拿到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一间书房，还是一座祠堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经记不清了......不知道为什么，我们对界园里的那些事记忆很混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想问你，这个物件，就是你说的，可以阻止炎国与岁兽开战的东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是后话了，当务之急是解决这满大街的鬼东西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫佚毫不客气地将物件劈手夺了过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舍尽残局，生之一手——"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女向前跃身，与左乐拉开距离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——是那日施展的禁术！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不可以在百灶城中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"点墨俯仰成青简，春秋开阖叙说人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山海之众敦请，一十二之五，承名为颉，现！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女手持信物，神情严肃，一通咒言念罢——\n却似乎......什么都没有发生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......看来不是这么用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜错了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，那也正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西再借我用用，等我研究清楚了，再还给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！休走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g1_tjoutside"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>望日前两日 辰时</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太阳出来的时候，那些怪物就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去，它们都是从这里跑出来的，这里就是源头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天镜阁......这里就是天镜阁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
